---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Reboot Your Computer" description="Learn about Reboot Computer Repairs. Experienced technicians serving Brisbane since 2008.">
  <section style="padding: 4rem 2rem; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9fafb 0%, #fff 100%);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">About Reboot</h1>
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #6b7280; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Expert computer repairs for Brisbane. Fast service, honest pricing, real expertise.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 4rem 2rem;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Who We Are</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            Reboot Computer Repairs has been fixing computers in Brisbane since 2008. We're a team of certified technicians who know every major brand and every common fault. We don't make excuses. We don't keep you waiting. We fix it right the first time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Approach</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            Most computer problems are predictable. Virus infections. Hard drive failures. Battery wear. Overheating. We've seen them all. We diagnose fast, explain what's wrong in plain English, and quote a fair price. If you approve, we fix it. If you don't, you leave with no obligation. Same-day repairs on almost everything.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <div>
            <h3 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Why We're Different</h3>
            <ul style="color: #6b7280; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Honest pricing. No call-out fees. You only pay for what we fix.</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Same-day repairs. Most jobs done before 5pm.</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Warranty backing. If it breaks, we fix it free.</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Real expertise. Certified technicians, not hobbyists.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Brands</h3>
            <ul style="color: #6b7280; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Dell, HP, Lenovo, Asus, MSI</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Apple iMac, MacBook</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">All desktop brands</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">All Windows versions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
      <div class="why-us-grid">
        <div class="why-us-item">
          <h3>Transparency</h3>
          <p>We tell you exactly what's wrong and what it will cost before we start.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-us-item">
          <h3>Speed</h3>
          <p>Most repairs happen while you wait. Same-day service is our standard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-us-item">
          <h3>Quality</h3>
          <p>We fix it right the first time. Every repair is backed by warranty.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-us-item">
          <h3>Integrity</h3>
          <p>Fair prices, honest diagnostics, no hidden charges. Ever.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Ready to Get Your Computer Fixed?</h2>
      <p>Call now for a free diagnostic and quote.</p>
      <a href="tel:+61731552002" class="btn btn-secondary" style="color: var(--color-white); border-color: var(--color-white);">07 3155 2002</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
